We now explore the degree to which the postulate proposed above describes the multiplicity evolution of measured \(p_{T}\) spectra measured in \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}=200\) GeV collisions at RHIC. As is frequently done, we will separately discuss the "soft" (\(p_{T}\lesssim 1\) GeV/c)

