function for different values of the upper limit of SL (see Fig. 8.8). Figure 8.9 shows the correlation function plotted vs SL. The enhancement of pairs observed above SL?0.6 is due the splitting tracks. Thus, based on Fig. 8.8 and 8.9 the upper limit on SL was chosen to be 0.6.

